       OSSL_PROVIDER-null - OpenSSL null provider

DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       The OpenSSL null provider supplies no algorithms.

       It can used to guarantee that the default library context and a
       fallback provider will not be accidentally accessed.

